<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/night rates fall to 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/night rates fall to 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 3.00 percent on Sunday from 3.56 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded in four reported transactions worth 5.5 million dinars ($7.8 million).</p>
<p>($1 = 0.709 dinars)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
